6-df-dtt-signature</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 为本文件引入的兼容谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DTTSig}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(\\Sigma)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>兼容入口仅指有限有序 contextual constants/equations 展示，配以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,\\Pi\">\\(1,\\Pi\\)</span>、强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、强 Eq 的明确演算；不泛指原书所有弱/强及高阶变体。</li>\n<li>来源及本次重建边界见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b1238220cc5942f\" href=\"?note=3b1238220cc5942f\" title=\"16-df-dtt-signature\">16-df-dtt-signature</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"DTT-signature-—-Compatibility-alias","text":"DTT signature — Compatibility alias","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为有限声明序列；$\\mathrm{DTTSig}$ 及其原始语法、规则闭包的完整定义见 [[16-df-dtt-signature]]。$\\mathrm{DTTSig}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为本文件引入的兼容谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-signature","status":"resolved","id":"3b1238220cc5942f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark